			"notes": "## Capture Egg 1.0.0\n\nInitial release of Capture Egg for Fabric 1.20.1.\n\n### Features\n\n- Capture and release one mob per egg\n- Fully reusable after releasing the mob\n- Supports vanilla and modded mobs\n- Preserves villager professions and trades\n- Displays the captured mob's name\n- Displays villager professions\n- Enchantment glint while a mob is stored\n- Shift + Right Click support for villagers and wandering traders\n- Ender Dragon cannot be captured by default"
